 # Changelog
 
+## 1.6.1
+
+- The monthly export (`exportMonth`) leaves out customers' email and phone, and gives what the items come to, the
+  discount and the shipping beside the total, so the accountant can reconcile each order. Customer names that begin
+  with `=`, `+`, `-` or `@` are marked so a spreadsheet shows them as typed rather than running them as formulas.
+
